# The credit lease stores embed Lua scripts whose bytes have to match the other
# SDKs' exactly, since a mixed fleet shares one Redis and Redis keys a cached
# script by the SHA1 of its text. A Windows checkout with autocrlf would rewrite
# the line endings inside those strings and split the fleet in two.
src/SchematicHQ.Client/Credits/Leases/RedisLeaseStore.cs text eol=lf
src/SchematicHQ.Client/Credits/Leases/RedisReservationStore.cs text eol=lf
